### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
###  WALLET SERVICE — Balance, Add Money, Ledger
### Base URL: http://localhost:8082 (direct) or http://localhost:8080 (via Gateway)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8082
@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:8080

### ── Replace these with tokens from 01-user-service.http ──
@aliceToken = <PASTE_ALICE_JWT_HERE>
@bobToken = <PASTE_BOB_JWT_HERE>

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 2.1 Get Alice's Wallet Balance
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallet/balance/alice@miniupi
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 2.2 Get Bob's Wallet Balance
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallet/balance/bob@miniupi
Authorization: Bearer {{bobToken}}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 2.3 Add ₹5000 to Alice's Wallet
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallet/add-money/alice@miniupi
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 5000,
  "note": "Monthly salary deposit"
}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 2.4 Add ₹3000 to Bob's Wallet
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallet/add-money/bob@miniupi
Authorization: Bearer {{bobToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 3000,
  "note": "Freelance payment"
}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 2.5 Add ₹100 to Alice's Wallet (add small amount)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallet/add-money/alice@miniupi
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 100,
  "note": "Cashback reward"
}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 2.6 Check Balance After Add-Money
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallet/balance/alice@miniupi
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 2.7 Get Alice's Ledger (Transaction History)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallet/ledger/alice@miniupi?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 2.8 Get Bob's Ledger
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallet/ledger/bob@miniupi?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{bobToken}}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 2.9 Try to Add Money with Invalid Amount (should fail 400)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallet/add-money/alice@miniupi
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": -500,
  "note": "Invalid negative amount"
}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 2.10 Check Balance of Non-Existent User (should fail 404)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallet/balance/nonexistent@upi
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}
